lass="text-[#3B3440] text-[20px] leading-[24px] tracking-tight font-normal mt-10 max-md:hidden text-center">WavveAI converts voice notes into text that&#x27;s easy to read. Create<br/>meeting notes, memos, emails, articles and more.</h2><div class="cta-section relative flex flex-col md:flex-col justify-start items-center md:items-center mt-11 gap-x-[15px] max-md:w-full gap-y-5"><div class="mic h-[108px] w-[108px] rounded-full bg-white flex flex-col justify-center items-center cursor-pointer border-[5px] border-solid border-[#469AFF]"><svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_41_13247)"><path d="M15 24V12C15 9.61305 15.9482 7.32387 17.636 5.63604C19.3239 3.94821 21.6131 3 24 3C26.3869 3 28.6761 3.94821 30.364 5.63604C32.0518 7.32387 33 9.61305 33 12V24C33 26.3869 32.0518 28.6761 30.364 30.364C28.6761 32.0518 26.3869 33 24 33C21.6131 33 19.3239 32.0518 17.636 30.364C15.9482 28.6761 15 26.3869 15 24ZM39 24C39 23.6022 38.842 23.2206 38.5607 22.9393C38.2794 22.658 37.8978 22.5 37.5 22.5C37.1022 22.5 36.7206 22.658 36.4393 22.9393C36.158 23.2206 36 23.6022 36 24C36 27.1826 34.7357 30.2348 32.4853 32.4853C30.2348 34.7357 27.1826 36 24 36C20.8174 36 17.7652 34.7357 15.5147 32.4853C13.2643 30.2348 12 27.1826 12 24C12 23.6022 11.842 23.2206 11.5607 22.9393C11.2794 22.658 10.8978 22.5 10.5 22.5C10.1022 22.5 9.72064 22.658 9.43934 22.9393C9.15804 23.2206 9 23.6022 9 24C9.00457 27.7173 10.3874 31.3008 12.881 34.0576C15.3746 36.8144 18.8018 38.5487 22.5 38.925V45C22.5 45.3978 22.658 45.7794 22.9393 46.0607C23.2206 46.342 23.6022 46.5 24 46.5C24.3978 46.5 24.7794 46.342 25.0607 46.0607C25.342 45.7794 25.5 45.3978 25.5 45V38.925C29.1982 38.5487 32.6254 36.8144 35.119 34.0576C37.6126 31.3008 38.9954 27.7173 39 24Z" fill="#383B43"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_41_13247"><rect width="48" height="48" fill="white"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div><p class="text-[#383B43] mt-[35px] text-[18px] leadin