one" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/RecordUploadWrite.76c412c8.svg"/><div class="flex flex-col justify-start items-center xl:items-end max-xl:flex-1 xl:w-[55%]"><p class="text-[#383B43] max-xl:text-center text-right font-semibold text-[38px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-3%]">Record, Upload or Write.</p><p class="text-center xl:text-right mt-[24px] text-[#7C7980] text-[18px] leading-[28px]">Whether you&#x27;re capturing audio notes or uploading files or writing content, Wavve will convert it into high quality text summaries for you. Choose the format you will.</p><a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="px-[24px] py-[6px] rounded-lg bg-[#4E8AF4] text-white text-[16px] leading-[28px] font-semibold mt-[40px]" href="https://app.wavve.ai/login">Know More</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row justify-between items-center w-full pt-[40px] pl-[48px] max-xl:px-10 max-xl:pb-[0px] bg-[#EEF5FC] rounded-xl mt-[12px] gap-x-[44px]"><div class="flex flex-col justify-start items-start w-full xl:w-[55%] mb-[40px]"><p class="text-[#383B43] text-left font-semibold text-[38px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-3%]">Set the tone of your notes</p><p class="text-left mt-[24px] text-[#7C7980] text-[18px] leading-[28px]">Select the intonation of how your summary should sound. We have hundreds of moods to choose from.</p><a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="px-[24px] py-[6px] rounded-lg bg-[#4E8AF4] text-white text-[16px] leading-[28px] font-semibold mt-[40px]" href="https://app.wavve.ai/login">Know More</a></div><div class="h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-end"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="448" height="250" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="-mb-[7px] select-none pointer-events-none max-xl:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/WavveRadioOptions.be727ca1.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="483" height="194" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="select-none pointer-events-none xl:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/howToUse1.aa909e72.svg"/></div></div><div class="flex gap-y-[34px] max-xl:px-[40px] flex-col xl:flex-row justify-between items-center w-full pr-[48px] pb-[40px] bg-[#EEF5FC] rounded-xl mt-[12px] gap-x-[44px] overflow-hidden"><div class="xl:h-full h-fit flex flex-col justify-start items-start"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="574" height="278" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="-mt-[60px] -ml-[5px] select-none pointer-events-none max-xl:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/ShareAnywhereImg.25df3a5d.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="583" height="278" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="select-none pointer-events-none xl:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/howToUse2.e0e2ce11.svg"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-start items-start xl:items-end xl:w-[55%] pt-[40px] w-full"><p class="text-[#383B43] text-left xl:text-right font-semibold text-[38px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-3%]">Share your notes anywhere</p><p class="text-left xl:text-right mt-[24px] text-[#7C7980] text-[18px] leading-[28px]">Social sharing and public sharing. Share your notes with your friends using the sharable URL link.</p><a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="px-[24px] py-[6px] rounded-lg bg-[#4E8AF4] text-white text-[16px] leading-[28px] font-semibold mt-[40px]" href="https://app.wavve.ai/login">Know More</a></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full flex flex-col justify-start items-center relative"><div class="w-screen h-fit mx-0 flex flex-col justify-start items-center overflow-x-hidden"><div class="w-screen h-[1788px] overflow-x-hidden absolute top-[-100px] left-0 min-w-screen" style="background-image:url(&#x27;/_next/static/media/central_background-min.29e482d9.png&#x27;);background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:top;background-size:100% 100%"></div><img alt="dots_background" loading="lazy" width="1440" height="1630" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute w-full h-auto" st